  "todaysAffirmationLabel": "Today's affirmation",
  "thereFallback": "there",
  "dailyAffirmation1": "Embrace and dance with your demons. They might change in color.",
  "dailyAffirmation2": "When you don't know where you are going, all roads will get you there.",
  "dailyAffirmation3": "Laugh now, cry later.",
  "dailyAffirmation4": "I have a dream...",
  "dailyAffirmation5": "If you think you are late to life, from that moment on you are at your youngest.",
  "dailyAffirmation6": "The real miracle is believing in yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation7": "Life is one day and that is today.",
  "dailyAffirmation8": "The truth is: the natural world is changing. And we are totally dependent on that world.",
  "dailyAffirmation9": "We are all made of stardust.",
  "dailyAffirmation10": "Dream with passion, live with responsibility.",
  "dailyAffirmation11": "Just look at what we can do when we come together.",
  "dailyAffirmation12": "Suffer now and live the rest of your life as a champion.",
  "dailyAffirmation13": "It's all going to be okay. Say it one more time.",
  "dailyAffirmation14": "Just take that step and try, it's enough.",
  "dailyAffirmation15": "Make a wave of positive changes.",
  "dailyAffirmation16": "Old ways won't open new doors.",
  "dailyAffirmation17": "Mistakes are proof that you are trying.",
  "dailyAffirmation18": "Your heart is the size of an ocean. Go find yourself in its hidden depths.",
  "dailyAffirmation19": "Be weird, be unique, be yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation20": "Whatever happens, happens for the best.",
  "dailyAffirmation21": "Actions can speak louder than words.",
  "dailyAffirmation22": "Since we existed, even for a moment, then we exist forever.",
  "dailyAffirmation23": "If saying goodbye hurts, it means you spent your time well.",
  "dailyAffirmation24": "If life gives you moments, make them good memories.",
  "dailyAffirmation25": "What goes around, comes around.",
  "dailyAffirmation26": "Diversity makes the world beautiful.",
  "dailyAffirmation27": "Everything is OK, no problem.",
  "dailyAffirmation28": "What you think, you become. What you feel, you attract. What you imagine, you create.",
  "dailyAffirmation29": "Strong minds grow in safe spaces.",
  "dailyAffirmation30": "Everything is possible, just try it. You can do it.",
  "dailyAffirmation31": "Every beginning is only a sequel, after all, and the book of events is always open halfway through.",
  "dailyAffirmation32": "I am grounded, resilient and open to growth even in uncertain times.",
  "dailyAffirmation33": "Be the person you needed when you were younger.",
  "dailyAffirmation34": "There is a crack in everything, that's how the light gets in.",
  "dailyAffirmation35": "I stand and fight to find my dreams.",
  "dailyAffirmation36": "Don't let the other decide your future.",
  "dailyAffirmation37": "The world needs more angry women.",
  "dailyAffirmation38": "The sun will rise and we will try again.",
  "dailyAffirmation39": "Wanderer, there is no path. You make the path while walking.",
  "dailyAffirmation40": "You don't have to be perfect.",
  "dailyAffirmation41": "Perfection is a Utopia. It only serves as compass.",
  "dailyAffirmation42": "Everything has a beginning and an ending, and the end can be beautiful, no matter how dark it seems now.",
  "dailyAffirmation43": "I raise up my voice — not so that I can shout, but so that those without a voice can be heard.",
  "dailyAffirmation44": "Everything that seems it is drowning you is actually just teaching you to swim.",
  "dailyAffirmation45": "If you have a goal, you will find a way.",
  "dailyAffirmation46": "After the rain comes the rainbow.",
  "dailyAffirmation47": "Every challenge I face is an opportunity to grow stronger.",
  "dailyAffirmation48": "I embrace the questions in my heart and welcome the answers in their own time.",
  "dailyAffirmation49": "The only approval I will ever need is mine.",
  "dailyAffirmation50": "Kill the urge to be chosen. Choose yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation51": "In hardships keep smiling. It makes them worry.",
  "dailyAffirmation52": "Not everything that is faced can be changed, but nothing can be changed until it is faced.",
  "dailyAffirmation53": "We shouldn't be looking for heroes, we should be looking for good ideas.",
  "dailyAffirmation54": "I see the sun, and if I don't see the sun, I know it's there.",
  "dailyAffirmation55": "Anyone who has never made a mistake has never tried anything new.",
  "dailyAffirmation56": "There's a whole life in that — in knowing that the sun is there.",
  "dailyAffirmation57": "Only fools never change their mind.",
  "dailyAffirmation58": "It always seems impossible until it's done.",
  "dailyAffirmation59": "Never doubt that a small group of thoughtful, committed citizens can change the world; indeed, it's the only thing that ever has.",
  "dailyAffirmation60": "Just do it already!",
  "dailyAffirmation61": "Beat the crying with a deep smile.",
  "dailyAffirmation62": "I'd rather die like a man than live as a coward.",
  "dailyAffirmation63": "Allow yourself to be authentic, even in places where everyone is expected to be the same.",
  "dailyAffirmation64": "You are best, keep going.",
  "dailyAffirmation65": "Believe in yourself. You can make miracles happen.",
  "dailyAffirmation66": "If you can worry about it, it means you are alive and it didn't and won't kill you.",
  "dailyAffirmation67": "With the flow of life, this too shall pass.",
  "dailyAffirmation68": "Keep going, one day it will be worth it.",
  "dailyAffirmation69": "Never be what the other wants you to be, be always yourself.",
  "dailyAffirmation70": "Don't forget to focus on the good things.",
  "dailyAffirmation71": "It's not selfish, it's self care.",
  "dailyAffirmation72": "Fear makes you weak; anger makes you strong.",
  "dailyAffirmation73": "When someone is drowning, you don't ask if they can swim — you just jump in and help.",
  "dailyAffirmation74": "The smallest good deed is far better than the biggest good intention.",
  "dailyAffirmation75": "Take the risk or lose the chance.",
  "dailyAffirmation76": "Believe that you can and you're halfway there.",
  "dailyAffirmation77": "Choose the one who makes your world beautiful.",
  "dailyAffirmation78": "The smallest act of kindness is worth more than the grandest intention.",
  "dailyAffirmation79": "Never regret a day in your life. Good days bring you happiness and bad days bring you experience.",
  "dailyAffirmation80": "Every pro was first an amateur. Start your dream now.",
  "dailyAffirmation81": "It might not be easy but it'll be worth it.",
  "dailyAffirmation82": "It is never too late to be what you might have been.",
  "dailyAffirmation83": "Everything you can imagine is real.",
  "dailyAffirmation84": "There is no greater agony than bearing an untold story inside you.",
  "dailyAffirmation85": "Pursue what catches your heart, not what catches your eyes.",
  "dailyAffirmation86": "Dare to be the best you can. At all times, Dare to be!",
  "dailyAffirmation87": "Never lose hope. Storms make people stronger and never last forever.",
  "dailyAffirmation88": "Cry. Forgive. Learn. Move on. Let your tears water the seeds of your future happiness.",
  "dailyAffirmation89": "When you're scared of losing yourself inside the light, just hold hands with your shadow.",
  "dailyAffirmation90": "Where earth separates to create space, there you can plant a seed.",
  "dailyAffirmation91": "If you've got nothing to dance about, find a reason to sing.",
  "dailyAffirmation92": "Sometimes the only way to ever find yourself is to get completely lost.",
  "dailyAffirmation93": "Everything is within your power, and your power is within you.",
  "dailyAffirmation94": "Your worth is not what you have, but who you are.",
  "dailyAffirmation95": "It's ok not to be ok.",
  "dailyAffirmation96": "After a thunderstorm there is always a rainbow.",
  "dailyAffirmation97": "Tomorrow is a new day. Shine!",
  "dailyAffirmation98": "Raindrops are little kisses from the Ocean.",
  "dailyAffirmation99": "Let all that you do be done in love.",
  "dailyAffirmation100": "Faith over fear.",
  "dailyAffirmation101": "Do more and more with less and less until you can do anything with nothing.",
  "dailyAffirmation102": "Be the love you want to see in the world.",
  "dailyAffirmation103": "There is a seat waiting for you at tables you haven't even seen.",
  "dailyAffirmation104": "Move like everything is gonna work out. Because it is.",
  "dailyAffirmation105": "I am always protected.",
  "dailyAffirmation106": "You will never miss out on what is meant for you.",
  "dailyAffirmation107": "Nobody is a professional human.",
  "dailyAffirmation108": "On top of the clouds the sun always shines.",
  "dailyAffirmation109": "Remember who cares about you.",
  "dailyAffirmation110": "Nothing matters, enjoy.",
  "dailyAffirmation111": "Being unhappy is the reason you can appreciate better days.",
  "dailyAffirmation112": "What if it turns better than you imagined?",
  "dailyAffirmation113": "You are enough.",
  "dailyAffirmation114": "I make my own path.",
  "dailyAffirmation115": "Be the change you want to see in the world.",
  "dailyAffirmation116": "Don't worry about a thing, cause every little thing is gonna be alright.",
  "dailyAffirmation117": "Give importance to what's important.",
  "dailyAffirmation118": "You can do anything but you don't have to.",
  "dailyAffirmation119": "The sun in the heart.",
  "dailyAffirmation120": "Everyone is useful, no one is indispensable.",
